Uxef
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 52 DEAL ROUJ
ROUJ 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ROUJ 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ROUJ 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ROUJ 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ROUJ 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ROUJ 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ROUJ 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ROUJ 2 FACE_ALL
ROUJ 7 FACE_ALL
ROUJ 5 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE ROUJ ROUJ
OR
    AND
        DEST Suit {HEARTS}
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS, SPADES}
    AND
        SRC Rank 1
        DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK ROUJ ROUJ
OR
    DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS, HEARTS}
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit match
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
DRAW
PILE ANY ROUJ Empty
$win
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
